{"3899880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Money Ring", "steam_appid": 3899880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4796550], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of classic roll-a-ball games, this game will throw you for a loop—literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of controlling a ball, you control a ring, which completely changes the way you move through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Super Money Ring</i>, you can ride along rails:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/0eaf5f9912088b57f2f185bdb85edf37.poster.avif?t=1784138176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/0eaf5f9912088b57f2f185bdb85edf37.webm?t=1784138176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/0eaf5f9912088b57f2f185bdb85edf37.mp4?t=1784138176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up steps or recover from bad landings:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/f1f75eafe475599f3cba1e61ffd2bc42.poster.avif?t=1784138176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/f1f75eafe475599f3cba1e61ffd2bc42.webm?t=1784138176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/f1f75eafe475599f3cba1e61ffd2bc42.mp4?t=1784138176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip the ring in place, ding off the floor, and gain height.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/85dcedcb82e21e930653aef2bb47f40d.poster.avif?t=1784138176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/85dcedcb82e21e930653aef2bb47f40d.webm?t=1784138176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/85dcedcb82e21e930653aef2bb47f40d.mp4?t=1784138176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new mechanics open the door for a wide variety of impressive skips and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/57354bbdc2e418b88351bac91f19237a.poster.avif?t=1784138176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/57354bbdc2e418b88351bac91f19237a.webm?t=1784138176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/57354bbdc2e418b88351bac91f19237a.mp4?t=1784138176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of this, <i>Super Money Ring</i> is less about careful precision and more about <strong>speedrunning</strong>. To really test yourself, race against anyone's ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899880/extras/4a3d662221d0